# This repo (dimension-strike-survival) commits the runtime binaries (models/ textures/ vendor/wasm/)
# and runs/ along with the source; fetch-assets.sh still works (idempotent, skips what exists).
# Only the API key stays out.

# Promo GIF capture frames and output (tools/promo-gif, ~1GB per run)
tools/promo-gif/out/

__pycache__/
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Survival scoring API key: local .env only, never committed
.env

# Raw screen recordings stay out (GitHub's 100MB per-file limit); the compressed demo video lives in docs/
*.mov
*.webm
